<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 70.1597 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 70.1597 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 70.1597 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.9554 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 21		  Oct 18</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     70.1597		 69.9554</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	     6.265		   3.470</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.7600		 45.4771</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	    0.030		   0.120</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
